# Change Request (CR) Template

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| **CR ID** | CR-YYYY-NNN |
| **Artifact** | (file and version, e.g., requirements/PSVS-REQ-v1.0.md, S7) |
| **Reason** | (why the change is needed, e.g., defect DEF-17: S7 contradicts S8) |
| **Impact** | (affected requirements, models, tests, proofs, cost and risk) |
| **Approver** | (name and role; decision: Approved / Rejected / Deferred; date) |

## Example

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| CR ID | CR-2026-001 |
| Artifact | requirements/PSVS-REQ-v1.0.md, S7 |
| Reason | DEF-17: S7 forbids temperatures above -18 C but S8 allows warming to 0 C |
| Impact | S7 and S8 reworded; chamber temperature constraint in /constraints updated; no change to S1-S6 |
| Approver | Mam Zubaira (Instructor) - pending |
